22→/**
23→ * Binary serializer for {@link JlsmDocument} values.
24→ *
25→ * <p>
26→ * The binary format consists of a header (schema version, field count, null bitmask, optional
27→ * boolean bitmask) followed by serialized non-null, non-boolean field values in schema order.
28→ *
29→ * <p>
30→ * Schema versioning: the header stores the write-time field count. On deserialization with a newer
31→ * schema, only the write-time fields are decoded; additional fields in the current schema are left
32→ * {@code null}.
33→ *
34→ * <p>
